  "title": "Chinese Spicy Hot And Sour Soup",
  "description": "Tiger lily buds, shitake and wood ear mushrooms add an exotic quality to this flavorful ground pork and bean curd soup made in a chicken broth with vinegar, white pepper and soy sauce.",
  "authors": [
